{"id":"fd99b4b9a3d6f4d86b79780c","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/sep/02/us-politics-latest-news-updates-donald-trump-iran","published_at":"2026-09-03T00:54:49Z","collected_at":"2026-09-03T01:31:29.722620Z","title":"Trump doubles down on Canada trade war as talks remain stalled – US politics live","text":"14.21 EDT Trump: 'Canada has been ripping off the United States for many, many years' The resumption of US-Canada trade talks does not seem to be on the horizon. During a press conference with US travel executives, Trump was asked if negotiations would resume. “Canada has been ripping off the United States for many, many years, for decades, many decades,” Trump said, adding shortly thereafter, “It’s a very unfair deal. They charge tremendous tariffs to our farmers. They take advantage of our farmers. They take advantage of our tourists. They take advantage of airlines.” The collapse of discussions resulted in Trump imposing 50% tariffs on $20bn in Canadian goods and Canada threatening retaliatory tariffs starting 8 September.","html":"","media":[],"author":"Dani Anguiano (now); Victoria Bekiempis, Lucy Campbell and Tom Ambrose (earlier)","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"fa09c4142b61084c421b526bb36c588603ade016ae0a24f5ea68c62628a0d972","original_text_chars":735,"original_html_chars":1127,"text_truncated":false,"media_count":0,"platform":{"entry_id":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/sep/02/us-politics-latest-news-updates-donald-trump-iran","entry_link":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/sep/02/us-politics-latest-news-updates-donald-trump-iran"}}}
{"id":"8f64fce7312cd453b6bc608f","source":"colonelcassad-tg","source_name":"Boris Rozhin","platform":"telegram","url":"https://t.me/boris_rozhin/224424","published_at":"2026-09-03T01:05:04Z","collected_at":"2026-09-03T01:30:54.716349Z","title":"","text":"\"Хочешь жить — беги. Хочешь выжить — убей\" Роман Сергеевич Горобець из Торецка (бывший Дзержинск). До войны — монтажник. В ТЦК медосмотр за 5 минут — свиньям из военкомата было насрать на его болезни. Отправили умирать за незалежную. Роман решил бежать — но командование заминировало дронами пути отхода. Чтобы никто не ушёл. Чтобы все подохли на месте. \"Вопрос ротации решён. Держитесь.\" — примерно так отвечают командиры на вопросы о замене. Держитесь, пока не взорвут дроном. Держитесь, пока мясорубка не перемолотит всех. ТЦК — конвейер смерти, командиры — мясники. @Sinkovka_Kupyansk","html":"","media":["https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/SW3Q0JHZzloKuAo6XBneC8stK2X8nCbrN8R7vaii2QzDyXZf-u0oH5ZOM1qFDlWj1xYotXQlCsRvQpAu6FOK-fePs9oWs0h1zZQOR6f71v6kk774d9oLzEi5t53E2ncR1lYuqgSWB58IOQ0EFdwHZXjuy1yHbM-hQu8Tf86mcLfQ7qD5rIfs6ilYpXFSth-kOLMEME5b2QO6YMKsCL10fFYNadpy1Sympj2zDUO0frZdxWf9ZBvSwzvKLa_HfUahjvCHL6v724bqxmmrQjKw8kFWMHKCQwJ4AORWokxrFfYMw3ycj3G_JoLpRerk0CSmR74xY72A5opSOp3q3eLyOw"],"author":"Boris Rozhin","language":"und","group":"ru-milbloggers","perspective":"russian","trust":"low","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"4aae212bcf199becba096c299e04b0e758ca6e6fa8630c707f533e368c01e6b7","original_text_chars":588,"original_html_chars":5589,"text_truncated":false,"media_count":5,"platform":{"post":"boris_rozhin/224424"}}}
